  src/sdk/lifecycle/claim.ts,project,"claim and release share the post-commit attribution policy: warning plus suggestion, never a non-zero exit after the write"
  tests/unit/core/item/core-item-lock-coverage.spec.ts,project,typed stale-lock refusal and its tracker-scoped cleanup step
  tests/unit/core/session/session-state-fence.spec.ts,project,a writer whose lease was reclaimed refuses with lock_lost and cannot overwrite newer state
  tests/unit/sdk/lifecycle/claim-attribution.spec.ts,project,post-commit attribution failure keeps claim and release successful with warning and suggestion
  tests/unit/sdk/lifecycle/stale-session-lock.spec.ts,project,"GH-1706 repro: claim and release reclaim an expired session lease"
